Recommends: xdg-utils
Description: USB debugging stack for Mobile Safari on Ubuntu
 Installs a local-only WebKit Inspector proxy for iwdp-mcp, an optional
 WebKit-to-Chrome DevTools Protocol bridge, diagnostics, systemd services,
 and a bundled browser-based Web Inspector. It uses Ubuntu's usbmuxd and
 libimobiledevice packages to communicate with trusted iOS and iPadOS devices.
